Dialogue: 10,0:00:07.43,0:00:10.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The end of the line is here!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.03,0:00:13.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This circle has the cutest vendors!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.11,0:00:14.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And the art is gorgeous...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.64,0:00:16.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Must be an original story.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.45,0:00:18.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura, we ran out of change!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.76,0:00:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.71,0:00:22.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, your booth is packed!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.83,0:00:26.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,May? Cecil?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.79,0:00:28.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.76,0:00:33.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I came because May said that\Nthis world has its own festival.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.37,0:00:36.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lord Hinata... what are you wearing?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.22,0:00:37.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,U-Uh, this is...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.83,0:00:40.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! One comic, please.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.93,0:00:42.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Give me just a moment!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.67,0:00:44.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect this many people...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.34,0:00:48.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miss Cecil, May...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.25,0:00:51.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but we need your help!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.62,0:01:59.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Limit one new comic per customer, please!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.53,0:02:01.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We brought more change.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.50,0:02:03.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.59,0:02:07.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Today, I'm here hanging out with\Nmy friend's doujin circle!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.27,0:02:10.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,May, you can stream later. Help us!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.93,0:02:13.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.89,0:02:18.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we actually sold all of them!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.15,0:02:20.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whew, that was hard work!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.64,0:02:23.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All you did was wave a camera\Naround in our faces.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.81,0:02:26.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, is this a festival?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.70,0:02:31.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well... for people like me,\Nit's the biggest festival of them all.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.00,0:02:35.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's completely sold out...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.59,0:02:38.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good job. You had fun, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.20,0:02:40.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes! Very much so!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.34,0:02:44.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, so your costumes were\Nmodeled after these characters.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.93,0:02:47.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup! Sakura made them for us.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.27,0:02:53.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you forget that you tore it earlier?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.09,0:02:56.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cosplaying's got its challenges.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.43,0:03:01.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is this...?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.43,0:03:02.57,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.57,0:03:05.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could I speak with Miss Sakura?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.08,0:03:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, that's me.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.61,0:03:13.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hello there. My name is Ando,\Nand I'm an editor for Takeshobo.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.50,0:03:14.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind me asking,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.92,0:03:18.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,are you interested in writing for\Na professional publication?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.05,0:03:19.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.80,0:03:22.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaat?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.17,0:03:28.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll reach out to you again at a later date.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.84,0:03:29.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.84,0:03:31.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,G-Goodbye...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.71,0:03:38.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Mochida!\NYou caught the attention of a publisher!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.60,0:03:40.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Gonna be a professional mangaka?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.35,0:03:41.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's not get carried away!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.86,0:03:46.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But... it's a nice confidence boost.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.02,0:03:47.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel like I can do anything now!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.83,0:03:49.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anything?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.06,0:03:51.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then let's take some pictures in the plaza!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.20,0:03:52.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.06,0:03:54.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Might as well since you're all dressed up.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.72,0:03:56.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell and Hinata, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.42,0:03:57.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want us?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.92,0:04:00.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah! The more the merrier!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.91,0:04:03.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Was this her plan from the beginning...?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.17,0:04:05.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Taking breaks is important, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.37,0:04:08.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cecil, you perform emergency\Nsurgery on Bell's costume!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.50,0:04:10.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura and I will dismantle the booth!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.88,0:04:14.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When we're done, we'll meet in the plaza!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.09,0:04:18.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I swear... When May gets like that,\Nthere's no stopping her.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.68,0:04:20.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you fix it?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.72,0:04:23.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As long as I've got a needle and thread.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.26,0:04:24.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For Pete's sake...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.68,0:04:28.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer that you avoid doing anything\Nto draw attention to yourselves in public.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.61,0:04:32.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've been tasked with bringing you\Nback home should something go wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.58,0:04:36.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wish you'd consider things\Nfrom my point of view.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.91,0:04:41.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want to drag you back\Nif I can help it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.41,0:04:44.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Which is why, Mariabell,\NI urge you to cooperate—
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.87,0:04:47.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lord Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.28,0:04:48.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mariabell?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.77,0:04:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.00,0:04:57.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're alone at last, Hinata-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.52,0:04:59.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're so adorable...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.60,0:05:01.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you really coming with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.80,0:05:03.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Which bathroom will you use?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.78,0:05:06.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Should your big sister\Nlend you a helping hand?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.80,0:05:09.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Quit it. People are staring at—
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.95,0:05:12.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, what...?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.61,0:05:14.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I used my magic to make us invisible.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.23,0:05:18.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To anyone without mana, it looks\Nas though nobody's standing here.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.83,0:05:21.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, Hinata-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.45,0:05:23.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.30,0:05:25.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm only disguising our physical presence.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.95,0:05:29.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you raise your voice or someone\Ntouches you, we'll get caught.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.62,0:05:31.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So be good, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.52,0:05:32.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't—
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.98,0:05:34.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.13,0:05:36.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, what do we have here?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.18,0:05:38.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata-chan, where did these come from?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.92,0:05:41.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-Mochida gave them to me...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.11,0:05:43.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you actually wore them?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.93,0:05:45.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hinata-chan. How kinky.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.47,0:05:51.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you wearing a bra, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.91,0:05:56.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good job, Sakura!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.21,0:05:58.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't mind batting for the other team\Nif it's with Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.66,0:06:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, which team?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.73,0:06:02.36,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey—!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.95,0:06:05.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look at your teeny-tiny boobies!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.30,0:06:07.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't have boobs!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.08,0:06:09.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Only girls do, and I'm not—
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.22,0:06:10.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.53,0:06:13.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll get caught if you're too loud, remember?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.00,0:06:18.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh no, all your squirming\Nmade the safety pin come off!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.79,0:06:20.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Naughty thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.18,0:06:23.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-But... it wasn't my fault...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.80,0:06:25.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.51,0:06:28.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-Not in public...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.60,0:06:30.36,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're going to drive me crazy...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.85,0:06:32.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's just fine by me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.86,0:06:35.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll embrace any and every part of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.44,0:06:39.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your kinky side belongs solely to me...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.08,0:06:42.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sh-She's intense...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.08,0:06:45.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh? Do I spy something beginning to\Npoke through your panties?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.87,0:06:47.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can't do this, Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.59,0:06:49.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course we can!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.16,0:06:53.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter that we're both girls.\NLove conquers all, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.77,0:06:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nope, not quite!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.00,0:06:56.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Put on some clothes!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.21,0:06:57.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tsk.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.02,0:07:03.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I almost had him...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.17,0:07:06.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not five seconds after I told you\Nto quit bothering Lord Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.05,0:07:07.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.65,0:07:09.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry we're late!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.18,0:07:10.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're all here.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.93,0:07:12.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's get started!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.12,0:07:17.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! May I take a photo?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.35,0:07:19.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's May from MayMay's Parallel Universe!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.92,0:07:22.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You were the vendors at that one booth, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.28,0:07:24.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can I get a picture, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.66,0:07:29.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright, one at a time, please!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.39,0:07:46.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nice job out there.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.01,0:07:47.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Photoshoots are hard work.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.80,0:07:48.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.76,0:07:50.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,May's in a good mood.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.68,0:07:51.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seems like it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.85,0:07:54.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She must be used to this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.44,0:07:59.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell looks great. I think she\Ncould be a popular cosplayer!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.37,0:08:01.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, probably...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.43,0:08:04.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm alone with Sunohara!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.71,0:08:07.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, Sunohara?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.24,0:08:08.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.59,0:08:10.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's just, that guy...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.33,0:08:12.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He keeps moving behind Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.62,0:08:15.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Does he have a hidden camera?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.30,0:08:18.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is bad!\NWe should alert a staff member—
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.29,0:08:22.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.89,0:08:25.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C-Can't move...!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.40,0:08:30.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you mind coming with me for a minute?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.40,0:08:31.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.43,0:08:33.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's your problem, bitch?! Let go of—
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.55,0:08:34.61,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,I'm a guy.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.39,0:08:40.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,WHAAAT?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.33,0:08:44.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sunohara...?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.89,0:08:46.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.50,0:08:50.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone was having a good time,\Nand I brought down the mood...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.05,0:08:53.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, you did nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.37,0:08:55.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I was a little surprised.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.45,0:08:56.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.37,0:09:00.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the first time I've ever seen\Nyou get angry, Sunohara.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.18,0:09:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When I thought about a stranger\Nrecording Bell without her consent,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.71,0:09:07.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just started moving on autopilot...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.72,0:09:10.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.10,0:09:12.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.32,0:09:15.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving me!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.64,0:09:20.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've become so desensitized to people\Ngiving me strange looks all the time.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.04,0:09:24.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really are my hero, Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.48,0:09:27.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A hero...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.47,0:09:35.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We took so many pictures.\NI can't wait to edit them!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.71,0:09:38.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm starving...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.34,0:09:40.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Should we eat something on the way home?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.59,0:09:42.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sunohara?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.29,0:09:44.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.43,0:09:48.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Earlier, when you rescued Bell\Nfrom that creep...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.38,0:09:54.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It definitely caught me off guard,\Nand I was a little unnerved, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.43,0:09:58.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...you were really, really cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.85,0:10:02.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-Y'think so?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.33,0:10:06.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell might think of you as a hero, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.33,0:10:13.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you to know...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.45,0:10:16.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you're a hero in my mind, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.85,0:10:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.25,0:10:33.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a weight off my shoulders!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.01,0:10:39.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata! Sakura! What are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.11,0:10:41.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's get going!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.54,0:10:43.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell's waiting for us.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.41,0:10:48.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Something happen?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.27,0:10:50.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nah, nothing too important.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.08,0:10:52.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aren't friends supposed to\Ntell each other things?
